<title>USA: Analysis&amp;Tech names chairman.</title>
<headline>Analysis&amp;Tech names chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH STONINGTON, Conn. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysis &amp; Technology Inc said Wednesday that chief executive officer Gary Bennett had been elected to the additional post of chairman.</p>
<p>He replaces James Fox, who resigned as chairman but remains on the board, the company said.</p>
<p>It also announced the election of Larry Fox, son of James Fox, as vice-chairman.</p>
<p>Analysis &amp; Technology works with customers to develop technology-based solutions in engineering services, information technologies and interactive multimedia training systems.</p>
</text>
